end framework, backend framework, database, authentication approach, file storage, email integration, PDF generation approach, hosting/cloud platform, CI/CD, monitoring/logging.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Each proposed technology choice includes a stated justification referencing expected scale and the 7-year data-retention requirement.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"If a proposed technology cannot demonstrably support 7-year retention (e.g. no durable backup/archival story), that choice is rejected or flagged as needing a mitigation (e.g. archival export strategy).\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"The retention requirement is explicitly recorded as 7 years for order and invoice data when evaluating storage/database options.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"The client approves/signs off the final stack choice before implementation proceeds; the implementation team cannot unilaterally lock it in without that approval.\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Interpreted as a deliverable requirement: the implementation team must produce a formal technology proposal covering each listed concern, justified against stated non-functional requirements.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-customer-auth-access\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can register/log in with valid credentials and reach their company's authenticated area.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Staff and admin users log in via the same or a separate authenticated flow and are routed to role-appropriate dashboards.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Invalid credentials, expired sessions, or locked accounts produce a clear rejection rather than granting access.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Role-based access restricts which actions/screens a customer, staff member, or admin can perform (e.g. only admins can manage users; only staff/admin can create orders on behalf of customers).\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"User accounts are associated with a role and a customer/company record, persisted for use in access checks and data isolation.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer attempting to access another customer's data (orders, invoices, pricing) is denied — data isolation between customer accounts is enforced.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers authentication and role-based access control as first-release features for a B2B portal with distinct customer, staff, and admin roles.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-catalogue-search\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can browse the product catalogue and view product detail pages with current stock and price information.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can search products by keyword, filter by category, and filter by vehicle compatibility (e.g. make/model/year) to narrow results.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Vehicle compatibility search returns only products marked compatible with the selected vehicle.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A search/filter with no matching products shows an explicit empty-state rather than an error or blank screen.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Product, category, and vehicle-compatibility data are stored and kept in sync with ERP stock import data.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers product catalogue, search/filtering, category filtering, and vehicle compatibility search as customer-facing discovery features.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-pricing-stock\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Each authenticated customer sees prices specific to their account/company (price list), not a single public price.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Stock levels are updated from periodic ERP CSV imports and reflected in product availability shown to customers.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"An ERP import file that is malformed or missing required fields is rejected, with the failure logged and prior stock data left unchanged (no silent partial corruption).\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer attempting to order more than available stock is blocked or warned at basket/checkout.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Each product carries current stock quantity and at least one price-list entry per eligible customer/company.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers customer-specific pricing and ERP stock import as backend/data-driven features affecting what customers see and can order.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-basket-checkout\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can add/remove/update quantities of products in a basket that persists across sessions for that customer.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"At checkout, the customer selects a delivery date/slot constrained by configured delivery scheduling rules (e.g. cut-off times, blackout days).\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Submitting checkout with valid basket, address, and delivery choice creates a new order and clears/archives the basket.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Checkout is blocked if the basket is empty, an item has become out of stock, or a chosen delivery slot is no longer valid — with an explicit error shown to the customer.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A confirmed order records the ordered items, prices at time of order, chosen delivery date, and the customer/company it belongs to.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers basket, checkout, delivery scheduling rules, and order placement as the core purchase flow.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-orders-history-tracking\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can view a list of their past orders and open an order-detail view showing items, status, and delivery info.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can view current order status (tracking) that updates as the order progresses through defined states.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can cancel an order while it is in a cancellable state, resulting in the order's status changing to cancelled.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can re-order a past order ('repeat order'), pre-filling a new basket with the same items (adjusted for current stock/price).\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Attempting to cancel an order that has already shipped/invoiced is rejected with an explanation.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can only view/cancel/repeat their own company's orders, not another customer's.\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers order history, order tracking, order cancellation, and repeat orders as post-purchase customer features.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-templates\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can save the current basket contents as a named template for future reuse.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can load a saved template into the basket, overwriting or merging with current contents.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can view, rename, and delete their saved templates.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Loading a template containing discontinued/out-of-stock items flags those items rather than silently adding them.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Templates are stored per customer/company, not shared across unrelated accounts.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers saved basket templates allowing customers to store and reuse common order sets.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-staff-order-management\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Staff can search/view all orders across customers and update order status (e.g. processing, shipped, cancelled).\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Staff can create a new order on behalf of a specific customer, using that customer's pricing.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Attempting a disallowed status transition (e.g. shipped → pending) is rejected and logged.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Only staff/admin roles can access order-management tooling and create orders for other customers; regular customers cannot.\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Staff-created orders and status changes are attributed to the acting staff user for audit purposes.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers staff order management and staff-created orders as internal-user features for handling customer orders on their behalf.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-delivery-csv-export\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Staff/admin can trigger a CSV export of orders scheduled for delivery, downloadable as a file.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Exported CSV contains relevant delivery fields (address, items, date/slot, order reference).\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"An export requested when there are no matching orders produces an empty/valid CSV with headers, not an error page.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Only staff/admin roles can generate delivery CSV exports.\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers delivery CSV export as a staff/admin tool for fulfilling and scheduling deliveries.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-invoicing-payments\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"When an order reaches the relevant state (e.g. confirmed/shipped), an invoice is automatically generated and linked to that order.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer or staff member can view/download the invoice as a PDF.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Each invoice displays and stores a payment status (e.g. unpaid, paid, overdue) that can be updated.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Invoice PDF generation failure is retried/logged rather than leaving the order with no accessible invoice indefinitely.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Invoices and their PDFs are retained for at least 7 years per the retention requirement.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A customer can only view their own company's invoices.\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers automated invoice creation, invoice PDFs, and payment status tracking as billing features tied to orders.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-admin-management\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"An admin can create/edit/deactivate products, categories, and vehicle-compatibility mappings.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"An admin can create/edit customer-specific price lists and assign them to customers/companies.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"An admin can create, edit, deactivate, and change the role of user accounts (customer, staff, admin).\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Attempting to deactivate the last remaining admin account is rejected to prevent total lockout.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Only admin-role users can access product, price-list, and user administration screens; staff and customers cannot.\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Administrative changes (product edits, price changes, user role changes) are written with the acting admin and timestamp.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers product administration, price-list administration, and user administration as admin-only back-office features.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-reporting-exports\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Staff/admin can view reports (e.g. sales, order volume) filtered by date range/customer.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Staff/admin can export report data as CSV for offline use.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"A report request for a date range with no data returns an empty result set with a clear message, not an error.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Only staff/admin can access reporting and CSV export features; customers cannot see cross-customer reports.\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers reporting and CSV exports as admin/staff analytics features.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-notifications-audit\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Email notifications are sent to customers on key events (e.g. order placed, order shipped, invoice generated).\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"An audit history log records significant actions (order status changes, admin edits, staff-created orders) with actor, timestamp, and action.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"If an email fails to send, the failure is logged/retried and does not block the underlying action (e.g. order still gets created).\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Only staff/admin can view the audit history; customers do not see internal audit logs.\",\n      \"kind\": \"permission\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Audit log entries and relevant order/invoice records are retained for at least 7 years.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers email notifications and audit history as cross-cutting system behaviours triggered by order/account events.\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"section-76-scope-responsive-retention\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Customer-facing screens (catalogue, basket, checkout, order history) render usably on mobile, tablet, and desktop viewports.\",\n      \"kind\": \"happy\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Order and invoice records remain queryable/accessible for at least 7 years after creation, even as volume grows.\",\n      \"kind\": \"data\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"text\": \"Data approaching or exceeding the 7-year mark is archived rather than deleted, unless explicit deletion is separately requested/required.\",\n      \"kind\": \"error\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Covers the responsive mobile-first buyer experience and the 7-year retention requirement as cross-cutting non-functional commitments.\"\n   }\n  ]\n },\n {\n  \"spans\": [\n   {\n    \"id\": \"74-estimation-checklist\",\n    \"beh